  "Almoravid Empire": ["Marrakesh","Abdallah ibn Yasin, Yusuf ibn Tashfin","The ████ gold dinar was so trusted that Christian Iberia imitated it as the morabetino, the origin of the Castilian maravedí."],
  "Ancestral Puebloans": ["","","Many ████ ████ buildings can be dated to the year their roof beams were felled: in 1929 a charred beam found at Show Low, Arizona, closed the gap in A. E. Douglass’s tree-ring record and gave the ruins exact dates."],
